# =============================================================================
# requirements.in — the direct dependencies, from which requirements.lock is
# compiled.
#
# Part of: google-maps-harness. Edit this file, then regenerate the lockfile:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --no-header -o requirements.lock requirements.in
# and restore requirements.lock's own header comment, which the compiler drops.
#
# One entry, pinned exactly. Everything else this server needs — HTTPS, TLS,
# JSON, URL encoding — is in the standard library.
# =============================================================================
